{"4734320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Arena", "steam_appid": 4734320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4784120], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fly. Stack. Die. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone Arena is a survivors-like arena roguelite. You pilot a combat </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>drone into a sealed arena, hold out against escalating waves of hostile </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>machines, and build a loadout powerful enough to survive the clock. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no checkpoints. Every run is a fresh attempt at a better build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/23a2f7d7be8c08c761e5dbf9085f7b9e.poster.avif?t=1786617780\" width=782 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/23a2f7d7be8c08c761e5dbf9085f7b9e.webm?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/23a2f7d7be8c08c761e5dbf9085f7b9e.mp4?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Builds That Break the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten weapons. Seven drone bodies. Each body changes how you fly, what you </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>can carry, and which weapons it wants. Items and power-ups drop mid-run, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and the interesting decision is never &quot;which is strongest&quot; — it's which </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>combination turns your drone into something the arena wasn't designed </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>to handle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/0ecd94ffe72e186f44037441ff723240.poster.avif?t=1786617780\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/0ecd94ffe72e186f44037441ff723240.webm?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/0ecd94ffe72e186f44037441ff723240.mp4?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Arena Fights Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves escalate, world events reshape the fight mid-run, and bosses arrive </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>to punish builds that only do one thing well. Survive to the end of the </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>timer and the next arena opens up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/b91fc2f508944d5fed2e10bfc8036c85.poster.avif?t=1786617780\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/b91fc2f508944d5fed2e10bfc8036c85.webm?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Runs, Long Nights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A run takes minutes. Learning why it ended takes one more. Drone Arena </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>is built around the moment you close the results screen and immediately </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>start again with a different plan.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Bring a Wingman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the arena on with a friend. Two drones, two builds, twice as much </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>going wrong at once.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try It First</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo is live right now. Play a few runs, then wishlist Drone Arena </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>to get notified the moment the full version launches.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/e9cbc2b744345432f0274e8b1c66004e.poster.avif?t=1786617780\" width=624 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/e9cbc2b744345432f0274e8b1c66004e.webm?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/e9cbc2b744345432f0274e8b1c66004e.mp4?t=1786617780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fly. Stack. Die. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone Arena is a survivors-like arena roguelite. You pilot a combat </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>drone into a sealed arena, hold out against escalating waves of hostile </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>machines, and build a loadout powerful enough to survive the clock. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no checkpoints. Every run is a fresh attempt at a better build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734320/extras/23a2f7d7be8c08c761e5dbf9085f7b9e.poster.avif